{"id":"word:hebrew:H5612","type":"word","title":"סֵפֶר","subtitle":"H5612 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, writing (the art or a document); by implication, a book","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to סֵפֶר (H5612) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 188 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"סֵפֶר (çêpher) means properly, writing (the art or a document); by implication, a book First listed occurrence: 1Chr 9 1."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"סֵפֶר","transliteration":"çêpher","pronunciation":"say'-fer","strong":"H5612","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5612","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["סֵ֛פֶר","סֵ֣פֶר","סֵ֥פֶר","סֵ֖פֶר","הַ/סֵּ֔פֶר"],"morphs":[["HNcmsc",75],["HTd/Ncmsa",30],["HNcmsa",22],["HRd/Ncmsa",18],["HR/Ncmsc",17],["HNcmpa",12],["HTd/Ncmpa",5],["HRd/Ncmpa",3],["HC/Ncmpa",1],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp2ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, writing (the art or a document); by implication, a book","usage":"bill, book, evidence, × learn(-ed) (-ing), letter, register, scroll.","full":"H5612. sepher סֵ֫פֶר 185 noun masculine Isa 29:11 missive, document, writing, book (probably ancient loan-word from Assyrian šipru , missive , message Dl HWB 683 , Tel Amarna šipru, šipirtu , id. Wkl TA Gloss ; √ šâpâru, send, send message or letter Dl HWB 683 , Wkl l.c., whence also sâpiru, writer , and (perhaps) ruler, šapirûtu, rule ; see Hom Aufsätze (1892), 34 Buhl Lex 13 ; perhaps compare Arabic go forth to journey , II. send on a journey Lane 1370 ; Late Hebrew סֵפֶר = Biblical Hebrew; so Aramaic סִיפְרָא ; Christian-Palestinian Aramaic Schw Idioticon 64 ; Arabic ); — ׳ס absolute 2Sam 11:14 +; construct Exod 24:7 +; suffix סִפְרִי 32:33 , סִפְרְךָ 32:33 ; Psa 139:16 ; plural סְפָרִים 1Kin 21:8 +; — 1 missive: a. letter of instruction, written order, commission , or request , usually from king, 2Sam 11:14-15 , 1Kin 21:8 (twice in verse); 21:9 , 11 ; 2Kin 5:5-6 , (twice in verse); 5:7 ; 10:1-2 , 6 , 7 ; 19:14 = Isa 37:14 compare 2Chr 32:17 ; 2Kin 20:12 = Isa 39:1 ; = written decree for publication Est 1:22 ; 3:13 ; 8:5 ; 9:20 , 25 , 30 ( = אִגֶּרֶת 9:25 ; 9:29 , see above), compare הָרֶכֶשׁ רֹכְבֵי בַּסּוּסִים הָרָצִים בְּיִד סְפָרִים וַיִּשְׁלַח 8:10 . &#8212; [ ס ׳כָּתַב 2Sam 11:15 ; 1Kin 21:8 ; 2Kin 10:1 , 6 ; 2Chr 32:17 ; בַּסּ ׳כָּתַב (of specific contents) 2Sam 11:15 ; 1Kin 21:9 , 11 ; ׳אֶתהַֿסּ קָרָא 2Kin 5:7 read the letter ]. — b. from prophet Jer 29:1 , other influential persons 29:25 ; 29:29 . 2 legal document , ׳ס כְּרִיתֻת certificate of divorce Deut 24:1 , 3 and (figurative) Jer 3:8 ; Isa 50:1 ; ׳ס הַמִּקְנָה deed of purchase Jer 32:11-12 , (strike out article), 32:12 ; 32:14 ; 32:16 , compare ׳בַּסּ 32:10 , הַסְּפָרִים 32:14 (si vera lectio; strike out ᵐ5 Gie compare Gf), סֵפֶר 32:16 b; 32:44 ; ׳ס = indictment Job 31:35 (object of כָּתַב ; בְּ ׳כָּתַב = sign Jer 32:10 , 12 , 44 ). 3 book , or scroll , in which something is written to preserve it for future use Exod 17:14 (E), Josh 18:9 (JE), 1Sam 10:25 ; Isa 30:8 ; Job 19:23 +; in form of roll, compare הַשָּׁמַיִם כַּסֵּפֶר וְנָגֹ֫לוּ Isa 34:4 , ׳הַסּ הֶחָתוּם 29:11-12 , (see Jeremiah 36, etc., below); particular: a. book of prophecies Jer 25:13 ; 30:2 6 t. Jeremiah 36; Dan 12:4 ; ׳ס נַחוּם חֲזוֺן Nahum 1:1 ; י ׳סֵפֶר Isa 34:4 ; so סֵפֶר מְגִלַּת Jer 36:2 , 4 (= מְגִלָּה 36:6 6 t.; with many columns, דְּלָתוֺת 36:23 ), Ezek 2:9 , compare Psa 40:8 . b. geneal. register , תּוֺלְדוֺת ׳ס Gen 5:1 (P), ׳ס הַיַּ֫חַשׂ Neh 7:5 . c. law-book , ׳ס הַבְּרִית Exod 24:7 (E), 2Kin 23:2 2Chr 34:30 ; 2Kin 23:21 ; ׳ס הַתּוֺרָה Deut 28:61 ; 29:20 ; 30:10 ; 31:26 ; Josh 1:8 ; 8:34 (all D), 2Kin 22:8 2Chr 34:15 ; 2Kin 22:11 ; Neh 8:3 ; ׳ס אֱלֹהִים תּוֺרַת Josh 24:26 (E), Neh 8:8 (reading ׳ס תּוֺרַת , so ᵐ5 , compare Talmud Nedarim 37b ), 8:18 ; 9:3 ; ׳ס י ׳תּוֺרַת 2Chr 17:9 ; 34:14 ; ׳ס משֶׁה תּוֺרַת Josh 8:31 ; 23:6 (both D), 2Kin 14:6 ; Neh 8:1 ; ׳ס משֶׁה 2Chr 25:4 ; 35:12 ; Neh 13:1 . d. book of poems, ׳ס י ׳מִלְחֲמֹת Num 21:14 (JE), ׳ס הַיָּשָׁר Josh 10:13 (JE), 2Sam 1:18 . e. book concerned with kings, ׳ס שְׁלֹמֹה דֵּבְרֵי 1Kin 11:41 , and especially ׳ס וגו לְמַלְכֵי הַיָּמִים ׳דּבְרֵי 14:19 , 29 31 t. Kings (18 t. of Israel, 15 t. of Judah), compare Est 10:2 (of Media and Persia); also דָּוִיד ׳ס לַמֶּלֶךְ הַיָּמִים דִּבְרֵי 1Chr 27:24 (reading ׳ס for ᵐ5 מִסְמָּד, Kit Hpt ); ׳ס וְיִשְׂרָאֵל לִיהוּדָה הַמְּלָכִים 2Chr 16:11 ; וְיִשׁ ׳יְהוּדָה ׳ס מַלְכֵי 25:26 ; 28:26 ; 32:32 ; ׳ס ׳מ ׳יִשׂ וִיהוּדָה 27:7 ; 35:27 ; 36:8 ; ׳ס ׳מ ׳יִשׂ 1Chr 9:1 ; 2Chr 20:34 ; ס מִדְרַשׁ ׳הָמְּלָכִים 24:27 ; also ׳ס הַיָּמִים דִּבְרֵי Neh 12:23 ; Est 2:23 ; ׳ס הַיָּמִים דִּבְרֵי הַזִּכְרֹנוֺת 6:1 . f. once בַּסְּפָרִים Dan 9:2 by means of the Scriptures (canonical books) compare Ew Meinh Bev Marti Kau . g. God's record-book , Psa 139:16 , ׳ס זִכָּרוֺן Mal 3:16 ; God's register of living, Exod 32:32-33 , (E), ׳ס חַיִּים Psa 69:29 ; ׳הַסּ Dan 12:1 (citizens of Messianic kingdom). 4 ׳ס = book-learning , especially writing: סֵּפֶר (הַ) יָדַע Isa 29:11-12 , (twice in verse) (of abilityto read); so כַּשְׂדִּים וּלְשׁוֺן סֵפֶר לְלַמְּדָם Dan 1:4 to teach them the writing and speech of the Chaldeans (on construction see Ges § 128a ); more Generally בְּכָלסֿ ׳הַשְׂכִּיל וְחָכְמָה 1:17 . &#8212; [ סֵפֶר book is joined with verbs thus: it is written ( יִכָּפֶב ) Mal 3:16 ; a thing is written ׳בַּסּ Exod 17:14 20t., ׳עַלסֿ 2Sam 1:18 50t. ( + Jer 36:32 ; בַדְּיוֺ with ink 36:18 ), ׳אֶלסֿ 30:2 ; 51:60 ; conversely ס מֵעַל ׳דָּרַשׁ Isa 34:16 , ס מֵעַל ׳שָׁמַע Jer 36:11 ; see also ׳בַּסּ וְיֻחָ֑קוּ Job 19:23 inscribe in a book , ׳עָלסֿ חֻקָּהּ Isa 30:8 (|| עַללֿוּחַ כָּתְבָהּ ); מִסּ ׳מָחָה blot out of a book Exod 32:32-33 , Psa 69:29 ; אֶתהַֿסּ ׳קָרָא Jer 51:63 read the book , scroll, but usually בְס ׳קָרָא 36:8 , 10 , 13 ; Neh 8:8 ; 8:18 ; 9:3 ; 13:1 ]. &#8212; ׳ס in ס ׳קִרְיַת , see ׳ק [ סִפְרָה ] noun feminine book ; — suffix בְּסִפְרָתֶ֑ךָ הֲלאֹ Psa 56:9 (compare סֵפֶר 3g ); strike out as gloss Bi Che Hup-Now Du. — compare also [ סְפֹרָה ] below","rootNote":"or (feminine) סִפְרָה ; (Psalm 56:8 ( 9 )), from 5608 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 9 1","keyReferences":["1Chr 9 1","1Kgs 11 41","1Kgs 14 19","1Kgs 14 29","1Kgs 15 7","1Kgs 15 23","1Kgs 15 31","1Kgs 16 5"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":188,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 9 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֖פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 41","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֖פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 14 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":14,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֛פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 14 29","book":"1Kgs","chapter":14,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֛פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 15 7","book":"1Kgs","chapter":15,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֛פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 15 23","book":"1Kgs","chapter":15,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֛פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 15 31","book":"1Kgs","chapter":15,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֛פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 16 5","book":"1Kgs","chapter":16,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֛פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 16 14","book":"1Kgs","chapter":16,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֛פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 16 20","book":"1Kgs","chapter":16,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֛פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 16 27","book":"1Kgs","chapter":16,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֵ֛פֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"H